gantt Customer Data Platform Migration
// stress: long-labels — task names of 50+ characters, the factory night chart's shape
// known: diagrammo/diagrammo#1415
start-date 2026-03-02

[Discovery]
  Inventory every upstream system that writes customer records today 5bd
  Interview the billing, support and marketing owners about field semantics 4bd
[Build]
  Stand up the ingestion pipeline with schema validation and dead-letter queue 10bd
  Backfill eighteen months of historical events from the legacy warehouse 6bd
  Short task 1bd
[Cutover]
  Run both systems in parallel and reconcile nightly differences until zero 8bd
  Decommission the legacy warehouse and revoke its service credentials 2bd
